(While an order is actively being prepared in the kitchen, staff can modify items, add instructions, or cancel it if a customer changes) Tj
T* (their mind. However, once payment is collected and the order reaches its final step \(e.g. Delivered\), the system permanently locks the) Tj
T* (order as Read-Only. This protects the business against internal cashier theft, prevents altered bills, and guarantees 100% tax \(GST\)) Tj
T* (compliance.) Tj
