/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.216 g
51.0236220472441033 353.5096850393700265 Td
(•  100% Tax & GST Safety: Under tax laws, invoice numbers must be continuous \(INV-001, INV-002, INV-003\). Deleting bills creates) Tj
T* (broken sequence gaps that trigger automated tax penalties.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.216 g
51.0236220472441033 326.0136220472440982 Td
